Package: ros-lyrical-wuji-hand2-2-description
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ros-lyrical-ros-workspace
Description: Robot model description package for Wuji Hand 2.2 with URDF, MJCF, and USD assets for simulation and ROS2 visualization.
 Hand 2.2 is Hand 2.1 plus one tactile-sensor pad link per fingertip. This package provides left and right models without covers.
